{"id":"3a061d5c71f82e51","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md","title":"Simplicial Complex","display":"df-simplicial-complex — Simplicial Complex","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-simplicial-complex","aliases":["58-df-simplicial-complex","Simplicial Complex"],"display":"df-simplicial-complex — Simplicial Complex","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-simplicial-complex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-simplicial-complex</span><span>Simplicial Complex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simplicial-complex — Simplicial Complex"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in V\">\\(V\\in V\\)</span>（顶点集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[V]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([V]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的有限子集族）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq[V]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(K\\subseteq[V]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>（抽象单纯形族）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（此处定义的抽象单纯复形谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim\\sigma\\coloneqq|\\sigma|-1\">\\(\\dim\\sigma\\coloneqq|\\sigma|-1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^{(V)}\">\\(\\mathbb R^{(V)}\\)</span>（有限支撑实函数空间）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|K|\">\\(|K|\\)</span>（此处定义的几何实现）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)\\leftrightarrow K\\subseteq[V]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in K\\;\\forall\\varnothing\\neq\\tau\\subseteq\\sigma\\;(\\tau\\in K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)\\leftrightarrow K\\subseteq[V]^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in K\\;\\forall\\varnothing\\neq\\tau\\subseteq\\sigma\\;(\\tau\\in K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex\\text{-}realization} \\vdash |K|\\coloneqq\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{(V)}:\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\;(x(v)\\geq0)\\bigr)\\land\\sum_{v\\in V}x(v)=1\\land\\operatorname{supp}(x)\\in K\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex\\text{-}realization} \\vdash |K|\\coloneqq\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{(V)}:\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\;(x(v)\\geq0)\\bigr)\\land\\sum_{v\\in V}x(v)=1\\land\\operatorname{supp}(x)\\in K\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\n\\dim K\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n-1,&amp;K=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sup\\{|\\sigma|-1:\\sigma\\in K\\},&amp;K\\neq\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\n\\dim K\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n-1,&amp;K=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sup\\{|\\sigma|-1:\\sigma\\in K\\},&amp;K\\neq\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>抽象单纯复形是对非空面向下封闭的有限顶点子集族；交集条件由此自动得到。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup K\">\\(\\bigcup K\\)</span> 只是顶点集，不是几何实现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|K|\">\\(|K|\\)</span> 由支撑落在某个面中的重心坐标组成。</li>\n<li>对无限维复形，面维数可能无最大值，所以必须取上确界而非最大值。</li>\n<li>本约定允许空复形，并令其维数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1\">\\(-1\\)</span>；若不分情况，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\\varnothing=0\">\\(\\sup\\varnothing=0\\)</span> 会把空复形错误地赋成零维。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的三角剖分是某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|K|\\cong X\">\\(|K|\\cong X\\)</span> 的同胚。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Munkres, Elements of Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"[V]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq[V]^{<\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim\\sigma\\coloneqq|\\sigma|-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^{(V)}","display":false},{"tex":"|K|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)\\leftrightarrow K\\subseteq[V]^{<\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in K\\;\\forall\\varnothing\\neq\\tau\\subseteq\\sigma\\;(\\tau\\in K)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex\\text{-}realization} \\vdash |K|\\coloneqq\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{(V)}:\\bigl(\\forall v\\in V\\;(x(v)\\geq0)\\bigr)\\land\\sum_{v\\in V}x(v)=1\\land\\operatorname{supp}(x)\\in K\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simplicial\\text{-}complex\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\n\\dim K\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n-1,&K=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sup\\{|\\sigma|-1:\\sigma\\in K\\},&K\\neq\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigcup K","display":false},{"tex":"|K|","display":false},{"tex":"-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup\\varnothing=0","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"|K|\\cong X","display":false}],"bytes":2003,"backlinks":[{"id":"b4d7921597565c97","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5e7476d444d4ade0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,V)$（see [[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]）"},{"id":"2ff75bf9c7039be0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7941b5e851990dd5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $|K|\\in V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md|58-df-simplicial-complex]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","36d7463d215be751"]}